{"4864370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deadtale", "steam_appid": 4864370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadtale is a brutal single-player FPS roguelike set in a living procedural apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Exo, built to enter places humans cannot survive. Each run sends you into infected territory where the world is alive with roaming enemies, predator animals, survivor camps, bandits, lootable locations, Infestations, Hives, and Hunters designed to track down and kill your kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals hunt. Zombies roam. Predators fight the infected. Bandits control territory. Survivors hide, trade, lie, or ask for help. The further you push, the more chaos you create, and the more dangerous the response becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clear surface Infestations, enter underground Hives, loot Points of Interest, trade with merchants, build your loadout, fight beside robots and companions, and bring back whatever you can before the world catches up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every decision has weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay too long, make too much noise, or push too far, and Hunters will come. These are not mindless infected. They are built from fallen Exos and exist for one purpose: to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are powerful. You are not safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal first-person combat with heavy weapon feedback, gore, ragdolls, dismemberment, and close-range chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural worlds with biomes such as Forest, Desert, and Jungle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living wildlife systems with prey, predators, and animals that react to the infected and to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infestations, Hives, POIs, survivor camps, merchant camps, and bandit camps discovered during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters that appear as you create more havoc and push deeper into hostile territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots, companions, drones, abilities, weapons, loot, upgrades, and build variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based progression where death ends your tale, but not your story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadtale is a brutal single-player FPS roguelike set in a living procedural apocalypse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as an Exo, built to enter places humans cannot survive. Each run sends you into infected territory where the world is alive with roaming enemies, predator animals, survivor camps, bandits, lootable locations, Infestations, Hives, and Hunters designed to track down and kill your kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animals hunt. Zombies roam. Predators fight the infected. Bandits control territory. Survivors hide, trade, lie, or ask for help. The further you push, the more chaos you create, and the more dangerous the response becomes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can clear surface Infestations, enter underground Hives, loot Points of Interest, trade with merchants, build your loadout, fight beside robots and companions, and bring back whatever you can before the world catches up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But every decision has weight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay too long, make too much noise, or push too far, and Hunters will come. These are not mindless infected. They are built from fallen Exos and exist for one purpose: to hunt you down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are powerful. You are not safe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brutal first-person combat with heavy weapon feedback, gore, ragdolls, dismemberment, and close-range chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural worlds with biomes such as Forest, Desert, and Jungle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living wildlife systems with prey, predators, and animals that react to the infected and to you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infestations, Hives, POIs, survivor camps, merchant camps, and bandit camps discovered during runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunters that appear as you create more havoc and push deeper into hostile territory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robots, companions, drones, abilities, weapons, loot, upgrades, and build variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run-based progression where death ends your tale, but not your story</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                </p>", "short_description": "Fight, loot, and survive in a brutal FPS roguelike set in a living procedural apocalypse. Build your loadout, face hordes, robots, wildlife, Infestations, Hives, and terrifying Hunters. Push deeper, bring back what you can, die horribly, and return stronger.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864370/fa8c50d8fa0003f5fbcf0ba64d31aa61f9852848/header.jpg?t=1788265532", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864370/a58c8051726b56da09e6f43f35a7d89a25dafcb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788265532", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4864370/a58c8051726b56da09e6f43f35a7d89a25dafcb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788265532", "website": "https://deadtale.com", "pc_requirements": {"m